# the Chords page: SELECT presses to it; a knob sets a step's chord, and with SELECT held its bars; the slate is kept
# with the piece, and goes with the recipe. A project from 1.3.1 (format 4) keeps its settings, its slate empty.
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 8
expect par28 0
spin K1 1
expect par28 1
shot chords.png
press SEL
wait 100
shot chords_bars.png
spin K1 2
expect par32 5
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 8
spin K3 3
expect par30 3
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par28 1
expect par32 5
expect par30 3
# back to the recipe: empty
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par28 0
expect par30 0
expect par32 3
# from 1.3.1
turn PRESET 4
expect piece 4
storev4 33
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 4
expect par0 33
expect par28 0
expect par32 3
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 33
